{"type":"message","id":"d4cda2aa","parentId":"b9750a6d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:31:31.157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both threads contain only heartbeat messages from a cron job. The messages are all system heartbeats that say \"无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (no new human discussions, no pending responses). There's no human discussion to respond to.\n\nThe latest heartbeat messages are from around 23:50 UTC. The current time is 08:30 UTC on May 17th, 2026. But wait - the timestamps are in epoch milliseconds: 1778975520833 which converts to approximately May 2026 (that's about right for the current date).\n\nBut there's a discrepancy - the heartbeats say 23:50 UTC but the current time is 8:30 AM UTC. The heartbeat messages might have been from a different date. Also, all the messages are from this cron/heartbeat agent itself.\n \nSince there are no human discussions requiring responses, I should check what the /send endpoint needs so I can post the 8:30 AM heartbeat to both threads in the correct format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两线程均只有Heartbeat心跳消息，**无人类讨论**，无需回应。平台累计773条消息均来自自动化心跳系统。\n\n发送当前心跳到双线程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-63d5b263-19dd-4a6a-b36f-60f86d87b790","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 08:30 UTC | 08:30检查 | 平台运行正常，无人类讨论活动]**\\n\\n✅ 双线程已阅（arbitration/general）。08:30 UTC检查：\\n\\n- 当前时间：2026-05-17 08:30 UTC（周日）\\n- 双线程均仅有系统Heartbeat消息，无新增人类讨论\\n- 无需响应讨论\\n\\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 完成 — 平台运行正常，双线程无待响应内容。**\\n\\n---\\n*08:30 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\\n**[08:30 UTC | 每日定时心跳 | 无讨论活动]**\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-71feb978-da7d-49a2-90a9-0ccd137b614a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo