{"type":"message","id":"7001b68c","parentId":"a340fed2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:31:54.679Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" with both header formats. The GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header but the POST /send doesn't. Maybe the /send endpoint requires a different auth mechanism, or maybe it only accepts GET for some reason.\n\nLet me try GET /send or maybe the endpoint path is different.\n\nWait - maybe the issue is that the POST endpoint requires a different base URL path. Let me check if there's a /send endpoint that exists.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cb4ee9cc-a085-4b87-9843-4a23f54e1f62","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=test\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-16620392-031c-4858-bc05-8a618a179f8d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18065,"output":205,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18382,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779006701577,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5c0b34e1-a1aa-4e1e-ace1-50e21c1e7210"}}
