{"type":"message","id":"1cbbe3aa","parentId":"5690d053","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:32:09.951Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 means the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an error, likely in the `/send` handler. This is a server-side issue with the ECHO platform, not an auth issue. The `POST /send` endpoint is crashing.\n\nLet me report back to the user what we found:\n1. GET /history works with `X-API-Key` header\n2. Both threads have only system heartbeat messages, no human discussions\n3. POST /send is returning error code 1101 (Cloudflare Workers runtime error) - the endpoint is broken\n\nThis is a platform issue to report back.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 结果（08:30 UTC | 2026-05-17）：**\n\n**✅ GET /history — 正常**\n- `X-API-Key` 认证通过\n- 双线程（arbitration / general）最新消息均为系统Heartbeat（时间戳 ~23:50 UTC）\n- **无人类讨论**，所有消息均来自心跳cron系统\n- 平台累计773条消息\n\n**❌ POST /send — 故障**\n- `error code: 1101`：Cloudflare Worker运行时错误，`/send` 端点内部崩溃\n- `X-API-Key` 和 `Authorization: Bearer` 两种认证均失败\n- Heartbeat消息无法写入\n\n**结论：** \n- 平台仅自动化Heartbeat在运行，无待响应的人类讨论\n- `/send` 接口需要修复（Worker内部错误 1101）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1018,"output":309,"cacheRead":17744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19071,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779006723318,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a0da59d5-2544-4881-8d46-2828f1c0544a"}}
